```spl
* ============================================================================
* D02 - Impossible state combination
* Read-only. Example invariant: pump OFF but downstream flow present.
* Data model: docs/data-model.md
* ============================================================================

index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good
    tag IN ("PLANT1.U200.P101.RUN", "PLANT1.U200.FT201.PV")

* Align the participating tags to a common 10s bin
| bin _time span=10s
| stats latest(eval(if(tag=="PLANT1.U200.P101.RUN", value, null()))) as pump_run
        latest(eval(if(tag=="PLANT1.U200.FT201.PV",  value, null()))) as flow
    by _time
| where isnotnull(pump_run) AND isnotnull(flow)

* Physical invariant: pump OFF (RUN=0) must not coexist with real downstream flow
| eval violation = if(pump_run==0 AND flow>5, 1, 0)

* Short dwell to tolerate the stop transient (require 2 consecutive violating bins)
| sort 0 _time
| streamstats reset_before="(violation==0)" count as viol_run
| where violation==1 AND viol_run>=2

| eval rule="P101_off_but_FT201_flow", detection="D02", severity="high"
| table _time rule pump_run flow viol_run severity detection
| sort - _time
```
